-- Optional: switch the database to the football store in one go.
-- Run in Supabase: SQL Editor -> New query -> paste -> Run. Safe to run again.
-- The same product can also be added with Admin -> Products -> "Import starter catalog".

-- 1) Delete every old (non-football) product. Orders keep their own copy of what was bought, so history is safe.
delete from public.products
where coalesce(data ->> 'category', '') not in
  ('boots', 'footballs', 'jerseys', 'accessories');

-- 2) Add the products. The first three keep any price/stock you changed in Admin (do nothing if the row exists).
-- The newer ones are refreshed from the site data when you run this again.
-- Stock is a PLACEHOLDER (5-10 per option): set the real numbers in Admin -> Products.

